From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] tty: 8250: add the T41 earlycon

The T41 uses the same early console as the T31/T20: the driver's
early setup reads the /ext clock and programs the UART registers, so
the console works before the UART driver, the CGU and the core INTC.
Add the ingenic,8250-uart compatible to the earlycon table.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_ingenic.c
+++ b/drivers/tty/serial/8250/8250_ingenic.c
@@ -172,6 +172,9 @@
 OF_EARLYCON_DECLARE(t31_uart, "ingenic,t31-uart",
 		    ingenic_early_console_setup);
 
+OF_EARLYCON_DECLARE(t41_uart, "ingenic,8250-uart",
+		    ingenic_early_console_setup);
+
 static void ingenic_uart_serial_out(struct uart_port *p, unsigned int offset, u32 value)
 {
 	u32 ier;
